---
title: "batch_price_attestation::deserialize (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_cursor: cur = cursor::new(bytes)
    q_cursor --> q_header: header = deserialize_header(cur)
    q_header --> q_counts: attestation_count = deserialize_u16, attestation_size = deserialize_u16
    q_counts --> q_init: price_infos = [], i = 0
    q_init --> q_loop: i < attestation_count
    q_loop --> q_deser_price: true
    q_loop --> q_destroy: false
    q_deser_price --> q_excess: price_info = deserialize_price_info(cur, clock)
    q_excess --> q_inc: consume excess bytes (attestation_size - parsed_bytes)
    q_inc --> q_loop: i = i + 1
    q_destroy --> [*]: cursor::destroy_empty(cur), return BatchPriceAttestation

    note right of q_header
        INV-001: magic must be 0x50325748 ("P2WH")
        INV-002: header_size must be >= 1
        INV-003: cursor must be fully consumed (destroy_empty aborts if not)
        INV-004: excess bytes per attestation are skipped for forward compatibility
    end note
